14:T4e6,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Do I need Shopify Plus for Shopify B2B wholesale solutions?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Shopify Plus gives you the most robust native B2B features and is recommended for high-volume Shopify B2B wholesale solutions. For smaller wholesale setups, we can build effective B2B solutions on standard Shopify using custom pricing apps and custom account management. We'll recommend the right approach for your scale."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can you integrate ERP with Shopify B2B wholesale solutions?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Our Shopify B2B wholesale solutions integrate with NetSuite, SAP, Sage, Brightpearl, QuickBooks and custom ERPs. Integration scope depends on your ERP's API and what data needs to flow in both directions."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can B2B and DTC run on the same Shopify store?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes — this is a common setup. B2B buyers see their account pricing and bulk interfaces; DTC buyers see the standard storefront. Shopify Plus makes this cleanest with dedicated B2B storefronts, but it's achievable on standard Shopify with the right architecture."}}]}9:[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Service\",\"name\":\"Shopify B2B & Wholesale Solutions\",\"description\":\"Custom Shopify B2B and wholesale solutions — tiered pricing, bulk ordering, net payment terms, account approval workflows and ERP integration. Sophisticated B2B on Shopify without the compromise.\",\"provider\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Agentix\",\"url\":\"https://agentixmarketing.com\"},\"areaServed\":\"US\",\"url\":\"https://agentixmarketing.com/services/b2b-wholesale-solutions\"}"}}],["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$14"}}],[["$","section",null,{"className":"svc-hero theme-dark","id":"top","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"hero-glow"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"wrap","children":[["$","nav",null,{"className":"crumb","aria-label":"Breadcrumb","children":[["$","$L15",null,{"href":"/","children":"Home"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"sep","children":"/"}],["$","$L15",null,{"href":"/#services","children":"Shopify Design & Development"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"sep","children":"/"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"here","children":"Shopify B2B & Wholesale Solutions"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"svc-hero-grid","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"Shopify B2B Development"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"svc-title","style":{"marginTop":18},"children":"Shopify B2B & Wholesale Solutions"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"svc-lead","children":"Shopify B2B wholesale solutions are the technical foundation that lets brands sell to trade customers directly through Shopify — with the pricing complexity, ordering workflows and account management that trade relationships require. Shopify B2B solutions, Shopify B2B store setup and wholesale ecommerce solutions on Shopify require more than toggling the B2B switch — they require custom Shopify wholesale development that handles the full complexity of trade operations. Running wholesale operations on Shopify requires more than flipping a switch. Sophisticated trade relationships need customer-group pricing, bulk order interfaces, net payment terms, account approval workflows and deep ERP integration — all in a system that your wholesale buyers find easy to use. We've built it across distribution, manufacturing, wholesale fashion and trade supply businesses. The result: faster ordering, fewer support calls, and more wholesale revenue."}],"$L16"]}],"$L17"]}]]}]]}],"$L18","$L19","$L1a","$L1b","$L1c","$L1d","$L1e","$L1f","$L20"]]
